{"id":"n50985-1-5","stage":5,"title":"드세다 · 狠","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50985-1-5-1","ko":"옷이 왜 이렇게 몽땅 젖었어?","zh":"衣服怎么全湿成这样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷이","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷이","audio":"/audio/4ed934dde6defcc6f810.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"몽땅","meaning":"都，全部","explanation":"몽땅：都，全部","readings":[{"term":"몽땅","audio":"/audio/82319e5dc862e392d58f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54717","senseId":"1","lemma":"몽땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몽땅","audio":"/audio/82319e5dc862e392d58f.mp3"}},{"text":"젖었어?","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젖었어","audio":"/audio/a49c96d9755ad881af92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"0