"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람에","audio":"/audio/2c70d627030132bf596e.mp3"}},{"text":"우산을","meaning":"雨伞","explanation":"우산：雨伞；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우산","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71103","senseId":"1","lemma":"우산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우산을","audio":"/audio/21bd32506dc8d1c0fce2.mp3"}},{"text":"썼는데도","meaning":"撑，打","explanation":"쓰다：撑，打；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"4","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"썼는데도","audio":"/audio/aadf9b85d2c07324b92d.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"됐네요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐네요","audio":"/audio/3d362a8fae49a2224410.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"0abe9f19a8697fab","term":"드세다","zh":"狠，厉害","audio":"/audio/0abe9f19a8697fabdd1e.mp3","entryId":"50985","definition":"力量或气势非常强。","pronunciation":["드세다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示后句的理由或原因。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示后句的理由或原因。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"8b6f9142a49be500","term":"우산","zh":"雨伞","audio":"/audio/8b6f9142a49be5004b82.mp3","entryId":"71103","definition":"在长竿上铺上像遮盖物一样的膜，下雨时用手举着遮雨的工具。","pronunciation":["우ː산"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"撑，打","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将雨伞或阳伞等展开而举在头顶上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/152ff8102f3af4ece6b2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50985","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为雨下得很大，虽然带了伞还是变成了这样。","衣服怎么全湿成这样了？","妈妈，这杯汁真好喝，是用什么做的？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["衣服怎么全湿成这样了？","妈妈，这杯汁真好喝，是用什么做的？","因为雨下得很大，虽然带了伞还是变成了这样。"],"answer":2}]}
